OL,3,GNEWSAHoliday village plans receive more
OL,4,Athan 300 objections
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans for dozens of holiday lodges on a
OL,7,Ffarm in rural Leicestershire have
OL,8,Freceived more than 300 objections.
OL,10,FThe application if approved would see a
OL,11,Fholiday village, including up to 45
OL,12,Flodges, built on Langborrow Farm, on
OL,13,FLaunde Road, one-and-a-half miles to
OL,14,Fthe east of Tilton on the Hill.
OL,16,FPlans also include a gatehouse, bike
OL,17,Frental and shop building along with a
OL,18,Fcafe/restaurant as well as indoor and
OL,19,Foutdoor leisure facilities and a new
OL,20,Faccess from and on to Oakham Road, the
OL,21,FLocal Democracy Reporting Service
OL,22,F(LDRS) said.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,366,360,200,160,0,100
