OL,3,GNEWSAHoliday village plans receive more
OL,4,Athan 300 objections
OL,5,
OL,6,FApplicant Brayden Cooper said the
OL,7,Fholiday village was "not a
OL,8,Fhigh-intensity events venue but a
OL,9,Flow-density eco-resort designed to
OL,10,Fconnect with nature".
